  "messages": [
    {
      "offset": 9451636,
      "text": "This section is the best one.\nIt has the largest range of Pok\u00e9\nBalls compared to anywhere else."
    },
    {
      "offset": 9451764,
      "text": "Good trainers stock up with tons of\nitems, providing you have the money\nfor that."
    },
    {
      "offset": 9451878,
      "text": "1F Balls & Battling"
    },
    {
      "offset": 9451930,
      "text": "2F Pok\u00e9mon Buffing"
    },
    {
      "offset": 9451981,
      "text": "I\u2019m standing here to make sure nobody\ntries to steal from these vending\nmachines!"
    },
    {
      "offset": 9452095,
      "text": "So many different items to choose,\nI simply can\u2019t pick!"
    },
    {
      "offset": 9637586,
      "text": "Things are back to how they always\nare around here, I should really get\nback to work."
    },
    {
      "offset": 9637674,
      "text": "I heard the news, the rest of the\nIslands are in the same condition...\nNow this one too, has been overun\nwith idiots."
    },
    {
      "offset": 9637824,
      "text": "The Dept. Store is no longer selling\nRare Candies.\nTurns out it was a scam by those\nNexus fools!"
    },
    {
      "offset": 9637923,
      "text": "I heard the Dept. Store is selling\nRare Candies right now.\nThat\u2019s a bit unusual, as they can\u2019t\nbe bought anywhere else."
    },
    {
      "offset": 9638075,
      "text": "The Gym Leader was just here a minute\nago, but he refused my challenge.\nWhat\u2019s up with that guy?"
    },
    {
      "offset": 9638174,
      "text": "I\u2019m hanging around outside the Gym\nwaiting for the leader, Rudy, to\nreturn.\nHe\u2019s never around to battle anyone\nwhen needed."
    },
    {
      "offset": 9638330,
      "text": "The famous Science Complex is just\nup this way.\nI hear they are working on a project\nto revive an ancient powerful\nPok\u00e9mon!\nI wonder what it could be?"
    },
    {
      "offset": 9638513,
      "text": "I should be at work right now in the\nScience Complex.\nI\u2019ve been stuck in here ever since\nthose guys arrived."
    },
    {
      "offset": 9638911,
      "text": "I like to spend my days reading all\nthe books here over and over.\nEvery time, I spot something new that\nwasn\u2019t there before!"
    },
    {
      "offset": 9639038,
      "text": "Quiet!\nIf I stay here and read books, they\nwon\u2019t notice me!"
    },
    {
      "offset": 9639130,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "offset": 9639133,
      "text": "Forget it, buster!\nThis is our time to shine!"
    },
    {
      "offset": 10426262,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "offset": 10432335,
      "text": "Pok\u00e9mon Enhancement Center\nBuff Up Your Pok\u00e9mon Big Time"
    },
    {
      "offset": 10432393,
      "text": "Pok\u00e9mon Enhancement Center\nBuff Up Your Pok\u00e9mon Big Time"
    },
    {
      "offset": 10432482,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "offset": 10432485,
      "text": "The Pok\u00e9mon Enhancement Center helps\nTrainers give special, dedicated\ntraining to thier Pok\u00e9mon to make\nthem stronger in various areas."
    },
    {
      "offset": 10432653,
      "text": "Grandpa has been obsessed with this\none tiny Pok\u00e9mon.\nToo bad he can no longer recall it\u2019s\nname...\nPerhaps you could help him?"
    },
    {
      "offset": 10434588,
      "text": "1F Balls & Battling\n2F Pok\u00e9mon Buffing\n3F Pok\u00e9mon Evolution\nTreats & Gifts"
    },
    {
      "offset": 10434695,
      "text": "Hello, welcome to Mandarin City Dept.\nStore."
    },
    {
      "offset": 10434772,
      "text": "I can\u2019t remember the last time I had\nenough money to actually buy\nanything here..."
    },
    {
      "offset": 10434887,
      "text": "When the receptionist isn\u2019t\nlooking, I\u2019m gonna jump over the\ncounter and grab up some goods!"
    },
    {
      "offset": 10435016,
      "text": "I heard a rumor that Rare Candies\nare currently on sale somewhere on\nthe floor."
    }
  ],
